cff-version: 1.2.1
title: "OSF_CCF: Multi-omics resources for colorectal cancer tumor-derived organoids and macrophages"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
authors:
  - family-names: "Fu"      
    given-names: "Zexian"     
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6945-086" 
    affiliation: "Hebei Uinversity of Engineering"        
version: 1.0.2
Doi:https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24459024
date-released: 2023-11-23          
repository-code: "https://github.com/dofuzx/OSF_CCF"  
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  Curated, de-identified multi-omics resources and analysis workflows for studying
  colorectal cancer tumor-derived organoids (TDO) and tumor-associated macrophages.
  Integrates public gut metagenome, single-cell RNA-seq and bulk RNA-seq cohorts,
  with scripts for microbiome analysis, single-cell annotation, WGCNA, machine-learning
  signature construction, mechanism mediation, docking preparation and robustness checks.
keywords:
  - colorectal cancer
  - tumor-derived organoid
  - macrophage
  - FOLR2
  - multi-omics
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - microbiome
